{"t":"Books","s":"books-6225e","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Almanac_of_Magic_da5435.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>There are many <b>books</b> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>. Their content range all from just a title, to clues for quests, to full length stories spawning more than just one book. You can usually find books in libraries in towns, but sometimes also near ruins of old houses, in dead trees or barrels out in the wilderness. These do often have a clue for a quest or how to find a place, item or key.\n</p><p>There is also a type of book that is magical. They are called <a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook\">spellbooks</a>. The magic thing about them is that their content changes depending on who is reading it. The content always tells which spells the person reading it knows and some information about them.\n</p><p>Not all books have text on them, but there are empty books that you can write in. Those can be bought in shops and/or found as loot from certain creatures. Note that there are other Writable Items which are not books.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Documents and Papers and Writable Items </i> </span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Books\">Books</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Attributes\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Weight\n</th>\n<th>Dropped By\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Almanac%20of%20Magic\">Almanac of Magic</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Almanac%20of%20Magic\"><img alt=\"Almanac of Magic\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Almanac_of_Magic_da5435.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">55.55\n</td>\n<td><ul